[28.970306, "o", "\u001b[29A\u001b[1G\u001b[K  \u001b]8;;https://www.superinference.org\u0007\u001b[2mwww.superinference.org\u001b[22m\u001b]8;;\u0007\r\r\n\u001b[3G\u001b[K\u001b[2mv0.7.4\u001b[22m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[90m  Provider: anthropic-vertex\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[90m  Model: claude-sonnet-4-5\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[90m  Working directory: /tmp/ami-demo-PhZFRG\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[3G\u001b[K\u001b[90mSession: session-20261113-190653-908-0\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[3G\u001b[K\u001b[90mPermissions: auto-allow\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[3G\u001b[K\u001b[90mTip: Type \u001b[1m/\u001b[22m to see available slash commands.\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[2m\u2298 Indexing skipped: no project root found\u001b[22m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[48;5;235m\u001b[38;5;255m > Activate the cognitive-doc-design skill, then use its guidance to write a README.md here for a \u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[48;5;235m\u001b[38;5;255msmall CLI tool called 'logslice' that filters log files by date range and severity. Keep it concise \u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[48;5;235m\u001b[38;5;255mand print the final README to the terminal when done. \u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;208m\u25b6 \u001b[39m \u001b[2m\u2234 Thinking #1\u001b[22m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[KI'll activate the cognitive-doc-design skill and create a README that reduces cognitive load for\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[Kusers of logslice.\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;208m\u25b6 \u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;35m\u25cf \u001b[39m\u001b[2mRan skill(Skill \"cognitive-doc-design\" activated inline. ...) 0.0s\u001b[22m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;136m|\u001b[39m Cooking \u001b[2m0.0s\u001b[22m\r\r\n\u001b[E\u001b[E\u001b[E\u001b[18G\u001b[K\u001b[32m\u2880\u28fa\u28d3\u2840\u001b[39m  \u001b[37m\u280a\u2811\u001b[39m       